WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.599
Chapter 1
A common myth about learning is that re-reading

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:17.939
is an effective study strategy – but it’s
not.

00:00:17.939 --> 00:00:22.480
Re-reading gives students confidence that
they know something when they actually don’t,

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.230
a key example in which “Learning is Misunderstood.”

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:27.230
Callender &amp; McDaniel (2009)
Karpicke et al. (2009)

