00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.380
Chapter 2
In “To Learn, Retrieve,” the authors describe

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.420
retrieval practice research in authentic classrooms.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:39.330
Experiments in a K-12 school district demonstrated
that retrieval practice raised students' grades

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.829
from a C+ to an A-, with benefits lasting
for an entire school year.

00:00:43.829 --> 00:00:44.829
McDaniel et al. (2011)
Roediger et al. (2011)

00:00:44.829 --> 00:00:45.829
View fullsize
