00:00:46.829 --> 00:00:47.829
Chapter 3
For this recommendation, “Mix Up Your Practice,”

00:00:47.829 --> 00:00:55.640
the authors present research on two robust
teaching strategies: spacing and interleaving.

00:00:55.640 --> 00:01:00.540
Research demonstrates that simply spacing
out or rearranging concepts to be taught can

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.539
yield a large boost in learning.

00:01:02.539 --> 00:01:03.539
Kornell (2009)
Taylor &amp; Rohrer (2010)

00:01:03.539 --> 00:01:04.539
