00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:02.540
Chapter 7
In this chapter, the authors reveal how to

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:04.420
“Increase Your Abilities.”

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.399
One method they highlight is a growth mindset,
or the belief that learning and intelligence

00:02:06.399 --> 00:02:07.399
are malleable rather than fixed.

00:02:07.399 --> 00:02:08.399
Growth mindset encourages students to focus
on learning and growing with increasing challenges,

00:02:08.399 --> 00:02:09.399
rather than performance at one point in time.

00:02:09.399 --> 00:02:10.399
This pays off in increased student learning
and persistence over time.

00:02:10.399 --> 00:02:11.399
Dweck (2008)
Paunesku et al. (2015)

