00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:14.950
Chapter 8
In the final chapter, called “Make it Stick,”

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.700
the authors provide tips for teachers, students,
and trainers.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:23.290
In collaboration with two of the authors from
Make it Stick, our Retrieval Practice Guide

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:25.950
highlights some of the tips included in the
book.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:30.750
We encourage you to read Make it Stick for
more research and recommendations to transform

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.139
student learning.

